# The root .gitignore excludes `*.stl` — a sensible rule for generated exports,
# and the reason the Booster K1's vendored meshes were silently dropped from
# their own commit (fixed later in 17d7659c). `git add third_party/` skips them
# without a word, tests still pass locally because the files are present but
# untracked, and the sample renders nothing on every other machine.
#
# These meshes ARE the vendored asset (see README.md), so re-include them.
!*.STL
!*.stl
!*.ply
